{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"mcp__figma__get_metadata_2_010da956","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"4:2\" name=\"Start Here\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1400\" height=\"4794\">\n    <frame id=\"4:3\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1272\" height=\"168\">\n      <text id=\"4:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"167\" height=\"17\" />\n      <text id=\"4:5\" name=\"Balance — personal finance app\" x=\"0\" y=\"29\" width=\"626\" height=\"58\" />\n      <text id=\"4:6\" name=\"Design the complete Balance mobile app: a personal finance app where Esaaa Warden signs up with a phone number, checks the balance, upcoming bills and transactions, manages cards and crypto assets, reads income analytics, follows a coin price, sends money to a contact and browses a community forum. Canvas 375 × 812, light mode only. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"99\" width=\"1272\" height=\"69\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:7\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"64\" y=\"288\" width=\"1272\" height=\"228\">\n      <text id=\"4:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"135\" height=\"32\" />\n      <text id=\"4:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 11 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / warning / disabled, chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the main navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use logos, card artwork, flags and icons from 04 · Media. People have no photos: use Avatar_Neutral or initials. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"48\" width=\"1272\" height=\"180\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:10\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"64\" y=\"572\" width=\"1272\" height=\"1844\">\n      <text id=\"4:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"379\" height=\"32\" />\n      <text id=\"4:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"48\" width=\"1272\" height=\"20\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:13\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"0\" y=\"84\" width=\"1272\" height=\"1760\">\n        <frame id=\"4:14\" name=\"01_Sign_Up\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"408\" height=\"346\">\n          <text id=\"4:15\" name=\"01_Sign_Up\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:16\" name=\"Goal: Start registration with a phone number.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:18\" name=\"• Actions: Continue • Copy: “Sign up” · “Sign up with phone number” · “A code will be sent to your number” • Legal: “By signing up, you agree to the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy, including Cookie Use.” (Terms of Service and Privacy Policy are links) • Phone: country code +62 (Flag_Indonesia, changeable) · number 858 2409 3560\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"152\" />\n          <text id=\"4:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"277\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:20\" name=\"→ Continue → 02_OTP\" x=\"24\" y=\"303\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:21\" name=\"02_OTP\" x=\"432\" y=\"0\" width=\"408\" height=\"289\">\n          <text id=\"4:22\" name=\"02_OTP\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:23\" name=\"Goal: Verify the phone number with a 4-digit code.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:25\" name=\"• Actions: back · Resend code · Continue • Code: 4 digits, none entered yet • Copy: “OTP” · “Enter code” • Legal: same text as 01_Sign_Up\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"76\" />\n          <text id=\"4:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"201\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:27\" name=\"→ back → 01_Sign_Up → Continue → 03_Home_My_Balance\" x=\"24\" y=\"227\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:28\" name=\"03_Home_My_Balance\" x=\"864\" y=\"0\" width=\"408\" height=\"555\">\n          <text id=\"4:29\" name=\"03_Home_My_Balance\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:30\" name=\"Goal: See the total balance at a glance and start money actions.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" />\n          <text id=\"4:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"108\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:32\" name=\"• Account: avatar · “Hi, Esaaa!” · messages entry · notifications entry • Actions: Send · Receive · Add • Balance: “Your Balance” $190,008.03 · +8% · currency USD (Flag_USA, changeable) • Main navigation: current tab Home • Spending: “Financial health” · “Latest 7 days” · daily spend Mon–Sun with values on a 10K–50K scale · entry to details • Transfer list: “Transfer list” · add contact · 5 contacts • View: switch between My Balance / Upcoming Bills /