ur number\".\n  - Continue button (instance of Button component 335×52) at (24, 300)\n  - Legal text centered near bottom: \"By signing up, you agree to the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy, including Cookie Use.\" with links styled (brand color, underline). Multi-style text: I'll create separate text nodes or use setRangeFontName/fills. Use one text node, then setRangeFills for link parts and underline decoration. Width 327 centered at (24, 700).\n\n### 02_OTP\n- Status bar\n- Header: back button (24,60) 40 circle; title \"OTP\" centered (20 SemiBold) at y≈66\n- \"Enter code\" title (24 Bold) at (24,140); subtitle? Brief copy: \"OTP\" · \"Enter code\". Add helper \"A code was sent to +62 858 2409 3560\"? Not in copy list; keep minimal: subtitle optional. I'll add small gray text \"Enter the 4-digit code sent to +62 858 2409 3560\"? Hmm \"must match Fixed data exactly\" — adding plausible helper is fine but risk mismatch. Keep to given copy only: \"Enter code\" as heading; maybe reuse \"A code will be sent to your number\"? That's for sign up. I'll add nothing extra.\n- 4 empty code boxes: 64×64 each, spacing: total 335 → 4×64=256, gaps 26.33 → x=24,114.3..., let's do boxes 70×70? 4×70=280 +3 gaps 18.33. Simpler: box 64, gap 26: 24, 114, 204, 294 → ends 358 > 359 ok within 24..351? 294+64=358, exceeds 351 (375-24). Use gap 25: 24,113,202,291 → 291+64=355. Slightly past margin but acceptable; or box 62: 24,112,200,288 → 350. I'll do 64 boxes with x=20 margin: 20,109,198,287 → 351. OK margin 20.\n- Resend code: centered text \"Resend code\" brand-colored at y≈380\n- Continue button at (24, 430)? Place lower: y=680? Typical: button right after code boxes: y=360, resend below 428. Layout: boxes at y=200; Continue at y=300; Resend centered y=372. Legal same as 01 at bottom y≈700.\n- Home indicator at bottom.\n\n### 03_Home_My_Balance (812 height) — dense\nLayout:\n- Status bar 0-44\n- Account row y=56: avatar 40 at (24), \"Hi, Esaaa!\" (16 SemiBold) at x=76, right ico