d to adjust existing nodes in frame03. Let me write a fix call that repositions things: I'll just reposition frames and internal elements. The FH card internal elements need adjustment too (bars at y=152-h currently; labels at 160). New chart bottom: 176, labels y=186.\n\nActually rather than many individual tweaks, simpler: set specific x/y on the main frames and adjust FH internals.\n\nFrame03 children: accI (y=60 ok), vswI y=120→116, bal y=176→168 resize to 327x120 (its internals: yt y=20→16, amount y=44→42? amount 32px → h~40; set y=40; chip y=94→86? 168+86+26=280 ≤288 ok → chip y=84; cur y=20 ok), actions frames y=328→300, resize 101x76? internal circle 56→52 at y0; label y=64→58. FH y=428→388, resize 327x208; internals: bars y=152-h → 176-h; labels y=160→186; axis labels y adjust: 54→78? axis 45K at y = 176-92 = 84 minus 6 = 78; 10K at y=176 - 20 = 156ish... bars: h=92*(v/45): min v=18 → h=37 → top=139. The axis 10K-50K... whatever, set 45K label y=78, 10K y=150. Title y=18→16, sub y=42→40, arrow icon y=18→16.\n\nTransfer list: y=666→604.\n\nLet me also fix: tls height 100→80.\n\nAlso check chip text position inside chip: chT.x was set to 21 then chI at 6 — chT y=(26-h)/2 set before x change... I set chT.x=(52-w)/2 then later chT.x=21. And chip width 52 with icon 14 + text... \"+8%\" text ~22px, icon 14, total 36 + gaps. OK.\n\nThen continue with 04, 05. Also I realize I should double check colors contrast etc. after screenshots.\n\nLet me write the adjustment + build 04 and 05 in next calls. Actually let me do adjustment call first (small), then 04, then 05 — can combine 04+05 in one call.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4ae3e056-c163-4c22-ba71-93fbd4764287","uuid":"7bac4ff3-5148-488d-81cf-7c42cf2e3877","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:17:34.884Z","thinking_duration_ms":21256}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":42297,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"02036ae1bd8e0a7ae0b4c7e0204334fc","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_14_5592c353","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const ws = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2003:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nconst f = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2008:60');\nfunction byName(parent,name){ return parent.children.find(c=>c.name===name); }\nconst accI = byName(f,'Home / Account Header'); \nconst vswI = byName(f,'Home / View Switch'); vswI.y = 116;\nconst bal = byName(f,'Balance Card'); bal.y = 168; bal.resize(327,120);\nbyName(bal,'Your Balance').y = 16;\nconst amt = bal.children.find(c=>c.type==='TEXT' && c.characters==='$190,008.03'); amt.y = 40;\nconst chip = byName(bal,'+8% Chip'); chip.y = 84;\nconst cur = byName(bal,'Currency Selector'); cur.y = 16;\nconst aS = byName(f,'Action / Send'); const aR = byName(f,'Action / Receive'); const aA = byName(f,'Action / Add');\nfor (const a of [aS,aR,aA]) { a.y = 300; a.resize(101,76); byName(a,'Circle').resize(52,52); byName(a,'Circle').x=24.5; const ic = byName(a,'Circle').children[0]; ic.x=14; ic.y=14; const lb = a.children.find(c=>c.type==='TEXT'); lb.y = 58; lb.x=(101-lb.width)/2; }\nconst fh = byName(f,'Financial Health'); fh.y = 388; fh.resize(327,208);\nconst title = fh.children.find(c=>c.type==='TEXT'&&c.characters==='Financial health'); title.y=16;\nconst sub = fh.children.find(c=>c.type==='TEXT'&&c.characters==='Latest 7 days'); sub.y=40;\nconst arr = fh.children.find(c=>c.type==='INSTANCE'); arr.y=16;\nconst days = ['Mon','Tue','Wed','Thu','Fri','Sat','Sun']; const vals=[24,35,45,22,34,18,30];\nlet bi=0;\nfor (const c of fh.children) {\n  if (c.type==='RECTANGLE') { const v = vals[bi]; const h = Math.round(92*(v/45)); c.y = 176-h; bi++; }\n}\nfor (const c of fh.children) {\n  if (c.type==='TEXT' && days.includes(c.characters)) c.y = 186;\n  if (c.type==='TEXT' && c.characters==='45K') c.y = 78;\n  if (c.type==='TEXT' && c.characters==='10K') c.y = 150;\n}\nconst tls = byName(f,'Transfer List'); tls.y = 604; tls.resize(327,80);\nreturn 'adjusted';","description":"Fix vertical layout spacing on frame 03","fileKey":"LoWw4yZnsmEbrzRZ2AMTxG"}}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4ae3e056-c163-4c22-ba71-93fbd4764287","uuid":"e37902c0-557a-413f-80d4-ab112d8c68f3","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:17:47.239Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_14_5592c353","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
