188',\n  logoPayPal:'2006:98', logoDANA:'2006:110', logoGooglePlay:'2006:119' };\nconst CMP = { tabBar:'2007:6', txr:'2007:68' };\nasync function icon(parent, compId, x, y, size, color){ const comp = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(compId); const ic = comp.createInstance(); parent.appendChild(ic); if(size!==24){ const k=size/24; ic.rescale?ic.rescale(k):ic.resize(size,size); } ic.x=x; ic.y=y; if(color) paint(ic,color); return ic; }\nasync function cmpInst(parent, compId, x, y){ const c = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(compId); const i = c.createInstance(); parent.appendChild(i); i.x=x; i.y=y; return i; }\nasync function scr(name,x,y){ const f=figma.createFrame(); f.name=name; f.resize(375,812); f.x=x; f.y=y; f.fills=S(C.bg); ws.appendChild(f); await cmpInst(f,A.statusBar,0,0); await cmpInst(f,A.homeInd,0,778); return f; }\nasync function detach(node){ if(node.type==='INSTANCE') return node.detachInstance(); return node; }\nasync function backBtn(parent,x,y){ const b=figma.createFrame(); b.name='Btn / Back'; parent.appendChild(b); b.resize(44,44); b.x=x; b.y=y; b.fills=S(C.white); b.cornerRadius=22; b.strokes=S(C.line); b.strokeWeight=1; b.strokeAlign='INSIDE'; await icon(b,A.iconBack,12,12,20,C.ink); return b; }\nfunction setTabActive(root, index){ root.children.forEach((tab,i)=>{ const sel=i===index; tab.children.forEach(c=>{ if(c.type==='INSTANCE') paint(c, sel?C.deep:C.gray); if(c.type==='TEXT'){ c.fills=S(sel?C.deep:C.gray); c.fontName={family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:sel?'SemiBold':'Medium'}; } }); }); }\n\n// ---------- 07_Cards ----------\nconst f07 = await scr('07_Cards', 2250, 0);\nawait backBtn(f07, 24, 56);\nconst t07 = await T(f07,'Cards',17,700,C.ink,0,0); t07.textAutoResize='NONE'; t07.resize(200,24); t07.textAlignHorizontal='CENTER'; t07.x=88; t07.y=66;\nconst avComp = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(A.avatar);\nconst av07 = avComp.createInstance(); f07.appendChild(av07); av07.resize(44,44); av07.x=255; av07.y=56;\nconst mv07 = figma.createFrame(); mv07.name='Btn / More'; f07.appendChild(mv07); mv07.resize(44,44); mv07.x=307; mv07.y=56; mv07.fills=S(C.white); mv07.cornerRadius=22; mv07.strokes=S(C.line); mv07.strokeWeight=1; mv07.strokeAlign='INSIDE';\nawait icon(mv07, A.iconMoreV, 12, 12, 20, C.ink);\n// Primary card\nconst cg = await cmpInst(f07, A.cardGreen, 44, 116); cg.name='Primary Card';\nconst holder = await T(cg,'Esaaa Warden',13,600,C.white,20,116);\nawait T(cg,'**** **** **** 3447',16,600,C.white,20,134);\nawait T(cg,'Exp 09/24',10,500,C.white,20,158);\nconst prm = figma.createFrame(); prm.name='Primary Badge'; f07.appendChild(prm); prm.resize(58,22); prm.x=293; prm.y=132; prm.fills=S(C.white); prm.cornerRadius=11;\nconst prmT = await T(prm,'Primary',9,600,C.deep,0,0); prmT.x=(58-prmT.width)/2; prmT.y=(22-prmT.height)/2;\n// Add Card button\nconst ac = figma.createFrame(); ac.name='Btn / Add Card'; f07.appendChild(ac); ac.resize(327,48); ac.x=24; ac.y=315; ac.fills=S(C.white); ac.cornerRadius=24; ac.strokes=S(C.deep); ac.strokeWeight=1; ac.strokeAlign='INSIDE'; ac.dashPattern=[6,4];\nawait icon(ac, A.iconPlus, 116, 14, 20, C.deep);\nconst acT = await T(ac,'Add Card',13,600,C.deep,142,0); acT.y=(48-acT.height)/2;\n// Assets\nawait T(f07,'Assets',15,700,C.ink,24,391);\nconst assets = [\n  {logo:A.sol, name:'Solana', t:'SOL', v:'$12,094.08'},\n  {logo:A.btc, name:'Bitcoin', t:'BTC', v:'$17,238.11'},\n  {logo:A.eth, name:'Ethereum', t:'ETH', v:'$8,200.00'}\n];\nfor(let i=0;i<3;i++){\n  const card = figma.createFrame(); card.name='Asset / '+assets[i].name; f07.appendChild(card);\n  card.resize(103,116); card.x=24+i*112; card.y=423; card.fills=S(C.white); card.cornerRadius=16;\n  const lg = (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(assets[i].logo)).createInstance(); card.appendChild(lg); lg.resize(32,32); lg.x=12; lg.y=12;\n  const nm = await T(card,assets[i].name,12,600,C.ink,12,52);\n  const tk = await T(card,assets[i].t,10,400,C.gray,12,70);\n  const vl = await T(card,assets[i].v,12,700,C.deep,12,90);\n}\n// Latest 3 transactions\nawait T(f07,'Transactions',15,700,C.ink,24,563);\nconst txs3 = [\n  {logo:A.logoPayPal, name:'PayPal', type:'Transferred', date:'Aug 19, 2023', amt:'-$123.00', sign:-1},\n  {logo:A.logoDANA, name:'DANA', type:'Transferred', date:'Jul 20, 2023', amt:'-$12.00', sign:-1},\n  {logo:A.logoGooglePlay, name:'Google Play', type:'Refund', date:'May 08, 2023', amt:'+$234.00', sign:1}\n];\nfor(let i=0;i<3;i++){\n  const r = await detach(await cmpInst(f07, CMP.txr, 24, 595+i*64));\n  r.name='Tx / '+txs3[i].name;\n  const oldLogo = r.children.find(c=>c.type==='INSTANCE');\n  const nl = (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(txs3[i].logo)).createInstance();\n  r.appendChild(nl); nl.resize(40,40); nl.x=oldLogo.x; nl.y=oldLogo.y; oldLogo.remove();\n  for(const c of r.children){ if(c.type==='TEXT'){\n    if(c.characters==='PayPal') c.characters=txs3[i].name;\n    else if(c.characters.startsWith('Transferred ·')) c.characters=txs3[i].type+' · '+txs3[i].date;\n    else if(c.characters==='-$123.00'){ c.characters=txs3[i].amt; c.fills=S(txs3[i].sign>0?C.green:C.ink); c.x = 307 - c.width; }\n  }}\n}\nconst tb07 = await detach(await cmpInst(f07, CMP.tabBar, 0, 714)); setTabActive(tb07, 2);\nreturn JSON.stringify({f07:f07.id});","description":"Build 07_Cards screen","fileKey":"LoWw4yZnsmEbrzRZ2AMTxG"}}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4ae3e056-c163-4c22-ba71-93fbd4764287","uuid":"eee7fcec-468a-478c-8dd1-3dfdb31e200f","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:26:25.012Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_25_7c5f84ff","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
